label chapter_1:
    stop sound
    scene bg event 1_001 with fade
    play music "audio/bgm/funny music.mp3" fadein 2.0 volume 0.7
    "{cps=35}After the welcoming ceremony, which had drained quite a bit of energy, we were all directed to our respective classrooms.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Of course, my class was Class B.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}“B”... {w=0.1} which in my mind stood for “Bland.” A place I hoped would give me some peace.{/cps}"
    play sound "audio/sfx/crowd.mp3" fadein 2.0 volume 0.5
    show bg event 1_002 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}And yep, just as I suspected. The classroom was very ordinary. Wooden desks lined up neatly and the smell of new books filled the room.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}In this new class, we gathered as classmates...{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_003 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Or rather... {w=0.1} as rivals? Considering how competitive the atmosphere was at this school.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_004 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}The once noisy classroom began to quiet down as footsteps were heard from the hallway. Some students turned their heads toward the door with curiosity.{/cps}"
    play sound "audio/sfx/walk.mp3" fadein 2.0 volume 0.8
    show bg event 1_005 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}A teacher entered slowly—dark mauve hair tied up neatly with two distinctive loops at the crown, dark-framed glasses on her nose, and a fitted dark suit that radiated professionalism.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Her steps were steady, creating a clear tapping sound on the classroom floor.{/cps}"
    stop sound
    show bg event 1_006 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Alright, is everyone seated?{/cps}"
    mrd "{cps=40}Yes, Ma'am!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_007 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Good...{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_009 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}My name is Chitose Nanami. I'll be your homeroom teacher until graduation day.{/cps}"
    mrd "{cps=40}Yes, Ma'am!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_010 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Huh... {w=0.1} so our homeroom teacher is a woman.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}From the cold and firm tone of her voice, she didn't seem like the type of teacher who liked to joke around.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_007 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}First of all, I'd like to know each of your names one by one so I don't misaddress anyone.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_011 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Let's start with you over there.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_012 with dissolve
    mc "{cps=40}Huh!?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Me, Ma'am?{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Who else? Don't pretend to be confused and stand up right away.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_012 with dissolve
    mc "{cps=40}Why not start from the front row, Ma'am?{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Because you've been staring blankly and not paying attention the whole time. So go ahead.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_010 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Sigh... {w=0.1} no use arguing. In the end, I'll still have to introduce myself.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Let's keep it low-key. I really don't want to stand out on this first day.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_014 with dissolve
    mc "{cps=40}Umm... {w=0.1} my name is [mc]. I don't have any particular hobbies... {w=0.1} Nice to meet you all.{/cps}"
    mrd "{cps=40}Nice to meet you!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_015 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Not too flashy, right? Good...{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_010 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}I quickly sat back down, hoping the class's attention would shift elsewhere.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Alright, next!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_010 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Introductions continued one by one. I half-listened until it was her turn...{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Now it's your turn.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_019 with dissolve
    g4 "{cps=20}Okay.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_016 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}She stood gracefully—crimson twin tails swaying slightly, the gold bell on her red choker giving a faint chime.{/cps}"
    sh "{cps=20}My name is Shirohana Shoko. Nice to meet you.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_017 with dissolve
    play sound "audio/sfx/jatoh.mp3" volume 2
    "{cps=35}She sat down without another word. Very brief.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_018 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Shoko, huh... {w=0.1} For some reason that name kept nagging at my mind. It felt so familiar, yet I still couldn't recall where I'd heard it before.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Alright, it seems there's one more student who hasn't introduced themselves yet.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}One more? I thought all rows had been called.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Then suddenly...{/cps}"
    play sound "audio/sfx/sliding door.mp3" volume 1
    show bg event 1_020 with dissolve
    g5 "{cps=60}Hah... {w=0.1} Hah... {w=0.1} Sorry, Ma'am! I'm late!{/cps}" with vpunch

    "{cps=35}A girl appeared at the doorway, gasping for breath. Her clothes were slightly disheveled from running.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Her crimson-red hair was the same striking color as Shoko's—though cut into a neat bob with bangs instead of twin tails.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_021 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}You! What time do you call this?!{/cps}"
    t "{cps=40}It's only the first day and you're already late. What's going to happen later on?!{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Miss Nanami looked genuinely furious. Her aura turned terrifying.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_022 with dissolve
    g5 "{cps=60}I'm so sorry, Ma'am... {w=0.1} I had an urgent matter I couldn't leave behind...{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_021 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Whatever your excuse, late is late! You're lucky the introductions aren't over yet.{/cps}"
    t "{cps=40}Now introduce yourself. NOW!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_023 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}Y-yes, Ma'am!{/cps}" with vpunch
    show bg event 1_024 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}*Ahem!* My name is Shirohana Yukie!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_025 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}She looked around the classroom with sparkling eyes, until she finally fixed her gaze on one spot.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_026 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}Ah! Big sis!{/cps}" with vpunch
    "{cps=35}Huh? Big sis?{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_027 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Ignoring the confused stares of the other students, Yukie walked straight to Shoko's desk.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_028 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}Shoko big sis! It's been so long! Three years, right?!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_029 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}I never thought we'd be in the same class!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_030 with dissolve
    sh "{cps=20}W-what are you doing... {w=0.1} It's embarrassing.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_031 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Seeing the commotion, Yuuka, who was sitting near the front left, could only shake her head.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_032 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Oh my... {w=0.1} On the very first day, there's already a noisy family drama like this.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_033 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Meanwhile, Vina tilted her head with innocent curiosity.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_034 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Wow... {w=0.1} they're twins but their personalities are so different, aren't they, [mc]? Truly unique.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Are you sisters?{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_035 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}Yes, Ma'am! We're non-identical twin sisters!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_036 with dissolve
    sh "{cps=20}Hey! That's enough! Be quiet!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}I see... {w=0.1} Very well. Yukie, please take the empty seat next to Shoko.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_037 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}Yes, Ma'am!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_038 with dissolve
    yk "{cps=60}From today on, I'll be counting on you, big sis!{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}Yukie said that with a beaming face, while Shoko looked like she wanted to disappear right then and there.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}Now that everyone has introduced themselves, I'll end today's class here.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_011 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}We'll start actual lessons tomorrow morning. Use your time wisely.{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_013 with dissolve
    t "{cps=40}See you later this afternoon, as I'll have some announcements to make.{/cps}"
    mrd "{cps=40}Yes, Ma'am! Thank you!{/cps}"
    show bg event 1_039 with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Miss Nanami left the classroom with her firm stride.{/cps}"
    scene bg classroom2 at sedikit_blur with fade
    play sound "audio/sfx/sliding door.mp3" volume 1
    "{cps=35}As soon as the door closed, the classroom atmosphere did a complete 180. The earlier stiffness vanished instantly.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Some started forming groups to chat, others laughed loudly...{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}And there were those who remained alone at their desks.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}That was me.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s10 at left with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Hey... {w=0.1} [mc]!{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Hm?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}What is it, Yuuka?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}So, [mc].....{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Why was your introduction so flat!? It had absolutely no effort!{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}At least say you like sleeping or something, so it wouldn't be so stiff.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Heh... {w=0.1} I did it on purpose so I wouldn't stand out.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}You're something else... {w=0.1} but you know, they say Class B is the dumping ground.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Huh, really?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Yeah. Apparently the students with higher grades are placed in Class A, and the rest... {w=0.1} well, they end up in Class B.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Where did you hear that? Don't tell me it's just a rumor.{/cps}"
    show vina s10 at right with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}I told her.{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}Vina suddenly appeared and joined our conversation as if it were the most natural thing in the world.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Since when have you been here?{/cps}"
    show vina s04 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}We're in the same class, you know. You didn't even notice I was nearby?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Oh come on... {w=0.1} I know you're oblivious, but at least observe your surroundings. That's just terrible.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Sigh... {w=0.1} scolded again. My head is starting to ache.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}It's not that bad...{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Then what?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}I just didn't expect her to show up so suddenly.{/cps}"
    show vina s03:
        yoffset 10
        ease 0.5 yoffset 0
        ease 0.5 yoffset 10
    with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Ah, that's just a habit of mine. Sorry if I startled you.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s01 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}It's fine when it's you.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s03 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}It's just him who's always been like that, totally oblivious.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Hey!{/cps}"
    show vina s12 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Ahaha, it does show on his face.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}It seems Yuuka enjoys teasing me in front of people I've just met...{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}I'm not that bad.{/cps}"
    show vina s13 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Yeah, yeah. We believe you.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}But seriously Vin, is our class really a dumping ground?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Everyone else looks smart.{/cps}"
    show vina s03 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}That's what's puzzling me too.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Don't tell me you're just spreading fake rumors.{/cps}"
    show vina s01 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Of course not.{/cps}"
    show vina s04 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}It's the truth. I know because my sibling is an alumnus here.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Huh... {w=0.1} I didn't know that. Which year?{/cps}"
    show vina s14 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Ah, it's been a while. They graduated about four years ago.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}So she has an 'insider'. Information from alumni is usually not just nonsense.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Then why did you come here? If your sibling graduated a while ago.{/cps}"
    show vina s10 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Well... {w=0.1} just to continue the legacy they started.{/cps}"
    show vina s12 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Besides, I didn't really have any other suitable schools to choose from.{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}A classic reason.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}If your sibling went to a certain school, you'd usually follow to make things easier for your parents.{/cps}"
    show vina s03 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}What about you two?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s08 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Well... {w=0.1} I chose this school because most of the students here are girls.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s03 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}To be honest, I have a bit of trauma with boys.{/cps}"
    show vina s14 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Trauma? But you seem really close to [mc].{/cps}"
    show yuuka s10 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Ah, that's because he's been my friend since childhood. We're also neighbors.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Yes, she's traumatized by boys due to an incident in the past...{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}But strangely, I myself don't remember what that incident was.{/cps}"
    show vina s04 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}I see... {w=0.1} so that's how it is.{/cps}"
    show vina s10
    show yuuka s01
    with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}So, what about you, [mc]?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Huh? Me!?{/cps}" with vpunch
    mc "{cps=40}Hmm... {w=0.1} my reason is classic. Because it's close to home.{/cps}"
    show vina s02 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Even though this school is mostly girls?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Well, it's becoming a co-ed school now, isn't it?{/cps}"
    show vina s04 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}But from the list of students accepted this year...{/cps}"
    show vina s10 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}You're the only male student here.{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}Huh? My heart nearly stopped for a moment.{/cps}" with vpunch
    "{cps=35}No way!{/cps}"

    mc "{cps=40}Don't make things up. I could've sworn I saw another guy in the auditorium.{/cps}"
    show vina s01 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}You must have seen wrong.{/cps}"
    show vina s02 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Here, everyone is female.{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}Crap... so that rumor was true? Am I really going to spend 3 years of high school alone surrounded by girls!?{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}But [y], when we left this morning, didn't you see any other boys at the gate?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04:
        yoffset 10
        ease 0.5 yoffset 0
        ease 0.5 yoffset 10
    with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Hm? Nope.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}I told you several times to reconsider your choice of school!{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}I know... {w=0.1} but I didn't know it would be this extreme!{/cps}"
    show yuuka s10 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Don't worry, [mc]. You have me to guide you.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Besides, you won't be able to do anything weird to other girls as long as I'm around.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Of course not. Have I ever even thought of doing anything weird?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s02 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Ahaha, I guess you're right. You've always been this stiff.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}But wait, since when did you two become so close?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s04 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Since when... {w=0.1} I guess just now.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s02 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Right, Vin?{/cps}"
    show vina s01 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Yeah. I'm the type who always starts a conversation first.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Yeah... {w=0.1} that was obvious from the moment we met.{/cps}"
    show vina s14
    show yuuka s01
    with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Oh, we're heading to the cafeteria now. You coming?{/cps}"
    show yuuka s02 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Come on, I'll treat you as a celebration of the first day~{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Hmm... {w=0.1} the cafeteria, huh...{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}I'm actually still quite full.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Plus, there's one thing I'm still curious about...{/cps}"
