    play sound "audio/sfx/crowd.mp3" fadein 2.0 volume 0.5
    "{cps=35}When we arrived at the cafeteria...{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}The atmosphere was very lively. The chatter of hundreds of students mixed with the appetizing smell of grilled bread and fried snacks.{/cps}"
    show vina s14 at right
    show yuuka s13 at left
    with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Wow, it's so crowded! Good thing we came early before the peak lunch rush.{/cps}"
    show vina s12 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Hmm... {w=0.1} it smells delicious.{/cps}"
    show vina s14 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}I heard the menu here has become quite extensive since the renovation a few months ago.{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}I don't really care about the menu... {w=0.1} as long as there's iced tea, I'm fine.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Sigh... {w=0.1} You always go for the cheapest thing. Zero sense of style.{/cps}"

    mc "{cps=40}What can I say? I'm pretty much flat broke.{/cps}"
    show vina s02 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Flat broke? Is that some new slang?{/cps}"
    
    mc "{cps=40}Not really... {w=0.1} just how I put it.{/cps}"

    "{cps=35}In other words, my wallet's been running on empty.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Lately I haven't been carrying much pocket money — I need to save for anything urgent that might come up.{/cps}"
    show vina s14 with dissolve
    v "{cps=60}Oh... {w=0.1} I was curious. I thought it was some secret guy code or something.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s06 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Don't get your hopes up with this guy, Vin.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s05 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}It's hard to expect anything interesting to come out of his mouth.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Tch, [y]... {w=0.1} Just you wait, someday I'll prove that I can be cool too.{/cps}"
    hide yuuka
    hide vina
    show bg canteen morning at geser with dissolve
    "{cps=35}I looked around again while lining up.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}No other guys at all.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}All the tables were filled with female students with all kinds of chatting styles.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}I felt like an alien that had landed on the wrong planet.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}I'm sure many were looking at me with a mix of surprise and pity.{/cps}"
    hide bg event
    show bg event 1_041
    with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Hey, [mc]... {w=0.1} What are you going to eat?{/cps}"
    
    mc "{cps=40}Hmm... {w=0.1} from the menu board, I'll go with something simple.{/cps}"
    
    y "{cps=60}Just say what you want, don't just say 'simple'.{/cps}"
    
    mc "{cps=40}I'll just have mineral water.{/cps}"
    show bg canteen morning at sedikit_blur
    show vina s14 at right
    show yuuka s06 at left
    with dissolve
    play sound "audio/sfx/jatoh.mp3" volume 0.7
    y "{cps=60}HAH!? Are you serious!? Just mineral water when I'm this hungry!{/cps}" with vpunch
    
    mc "{cps=40}Fine, you decide. I'll have whatever you get.{/cps}"
    show yuuka s10 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Alright then, I'll order 3 sandwiches!{/cps}"
    show yuuka s12 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}And... {w=0.1} [mc] pays first!{/cps}"
    play sound "audio/sfx/jatoh.mp3" volume 0.7
    mc "{cps=40}HAH!? Weren't you the one who said you'd treat me?!{/cps}" with vpunch
    show yuuka s13 with dissolve
    y "{cps=60}Come on Vin, let's find a seat before it gets packed! Hurry!{/cps}"
    mc "{cps=40}Hey! Wait up!{/cps}"
    hide yuuka with moveoutright
    hide vina with moveoutright
    "{cps=35}[y] grabbed [v]'s hand and dashed off to find an empty table in the corner.{/cps}"
    hide bg event
    show bg event 1_042
    with dissolve
    "{cps=35}Leaving me alone at the counter.{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Important lesson for myself today:{/cps}"
    "{cps=35}Never accept a girl's invitation easily, no matter how tempting it looks.{/cps}"
